      {
        "content": "The Water Workers Union stands ready to strike if the city council votes for the 9 percent tariff plan without a guaranteed guarantee for our 200 maintenance positions. The revised plan is not just about rates; it is about the survival of our jobs and the integrity of our workforce.",
