        "poster_type": "Union"
      },
      {
        "content": "We have paid $4.2 million to Brightline Consulting for a pipeline study. Our Acting CEO, Nadia Okafor, will publish every contract to restore public trust. Transparency is our only path forward as we prepare for the July 15th vote.",
        "poster_agent_id": 7,
        "poster_type": "Organization"
      },
      {
        "content": "Breaking: Despite the scandal, some council members are leaning towards supporting the 9 percent plan to avoid a rate hike that could bankrupt the city. The debate over job guarantees vs. fiscal responsibility is intensifying as the vote nears.",
