        "poster_type": "MediaOutlet"
      },
      {
        "content": "Renters in the Eastside district are not happy. We oppose shared meters and demand that the new tariff plan addresses the unfair pricing we face compared to homeowners. The discount for low-income households is a start, but not enough.",
